      "titulo": "Have to",
      "texto": "**Tener que** + infinitive says who has to do it: **tengo que** estudiar.\n\n**Hay que** + infinitive is general: **hay que** llegar a las nueve. There is no person.\n\n**Porque** gives the reason and usually follows the result: estudio **porque** mañana hay un examen."
